[options]
[A.]
<$PlaySound,shortThunderCrack.wav>
                                                     <h2>Apprenticeship~.<a href="#mission1">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
            ~[Iburied.1]
<br>                                                             ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.<br>
After you lost the Great Tournament of the Furies you were cast into
the mystical Realm of Hades where you fought the King of Hades Priests'
where you won your right to live freely - in the Realm of Hades that is.
<br>
The {sw_god5} has offered you the position of ~kApprentice~. of {sw_hades}<br>
                                ~yWill you take it?~.
<br>
There are four elemental Gods (known to Nimbians as <i>THE FURIES</i>). The God
of ~lRain~., the God of ~mThunder~., the God of ~oWind~., and the infamous God of ~kDeath~. (King ~rHades~. himself).
The other Gods created ~rHades~. for all of the lost souls that were sacrificed in battle.  However,
they needed a ruler of this new realm and therefore, created another God.
<br>
{sw_hades} is an immortal God, just like the rest, except he becomes mortal outside of his realm.  If he is lured outside of his
realm then he can be killed.
<br>
            <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                                  <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                            <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>                            <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Enter Hades Realm</a>                    <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">I'm too Scared!</a>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,priestMove1.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.


[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}</h2>
<p>
<i>You killed <?{sw_enDead5}>both</?><?!{sw_enDead5}>half</?> of my Demon
 Dogs of Wind. I'll grant you knowledge.</i>
<$Config,sw_enDead2=1>
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Menu=~yWhat did I get?,GetTechnology,70

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}</h2>
<p>
<i>You killed <?{sw_enDead2}>both</?><?!{sw_enDead2}>half</?> of my Demon
