[NoDeal]
<$Config,sw_pickally1=0>
<p>~gFoolish Mortal!<br>
~wDo you really think I'll let you leave here alive?
$Button=To Your Death,DoNothing,0

[ai1TempleHalfDead]
<p>
It looks as if you are in trouble!

[ai1TempleDead]
                               Where will you run to now priest?
<p>
<h2>                    You receive a message.</h2><br>
<i>"You fought well, brave priest."      
<p>
"I want you to stay here and help me conquer those darn Nimbians.<br>
If you don't I will kill your Dead Nimbian Butt!"<br>
                                                     --The {sw_god5}</i>
<p>
<i>"Will you be my new apprentice of Hades?<br>
I will teach you all that I know so we can conquer Nimbus together."</i>

$Button=I'LL BE YOUR NIMBIAN SLAVE,Tell,AllianceBegun
$Button=I'D RATHER DIE 1000 DEATHS,Tell NoDeal
$Timeout=25,Tell,AllianceWithdrawn


[ai1PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}.</h2><br>
<i>"If you beg for mercy on your grovelling knees I might spare you."</i>
<p>
It appears that you have been <i>beaten</i>.  Will you beg for your life?

$Button=SPARE ME YOUR HIGNESS,Tell,MercyGranted
$Button=I'D RATHER KISS A DEAD BULF'S BUTT,Tell,NoMercy
$Timeout=20,Tell,MercyWithdrawn


[MercyGranted]
<$Config,sw_pickally1=1>
<$Config,sw_m4=1>
<$Config,sw_m1=0>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=5000>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=6000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=5>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=3000>
