<$MissionBegin,sw_m4>


[NoMercy]
<$Config,sw_pickally1=0>
{sw_god5} says:
<p>
<?{sw_difficulty1}>
<i>"I'll get pleasure watching you burn on my altar.</i>
<$Config,sw_m24=1>
<$Config,sw_m1=0>
$Button=What have I done?,MissionBegin,sw_m24
</?>
<?!{sw_difficulty1}>
<i>"HAW HAW! Foolish mortal. You cower in fear before me. You fight
with no spirit!"
<p>"Was the battle too tough for you? You fight like your life doesn't depend
on it. It does! Perhaps I have underestimated your skill..."
<p>"I will grant you 1 last chance, then it's off to HADES with you. I will not
 waste my time with you any longer."
<p>"If you fail again, I'll get pleasure watching you burn on my altar."</i>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=4000>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=1000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=8>
$Button=Try again. Make it easier,MissionBegin,sw_m1
</?>

[MercyWithdrawn]
The {sw_god5} quickly changes his mind! He demands worship and devotion!
Your indecision makes him Furious! Watch out for his anger!
